Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:07.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)}The radiance of the night shines through my window
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.17,0:00:11.12,Opening,,0,0,0,,but the path to immortality is long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:15.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.85,0:00:21.01,Opening,,0,0,0,,Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.28,0:00:25.00,Opening,,0,0,0,,Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:28.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:33.52,Opening,,0,0,0,,The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:37.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:40.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,as the storm rages just below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:44.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.85,0:00:47.84,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:50.69,Opening,,0,0,0,,why the world is a-changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.71,0:00:54.04,Opening,,0,0,0,,Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:57.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:01:00.29,Opening,,0,0,0,,experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.45,0:01:03.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will defy the light in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:06.61,Opening,,0,0,0,,to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.69,0:01:19.05,Opening,,0,0,0,,Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.21,0:01:22.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,Transform your insignificant body into light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:25.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,The hardships of the journey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.37,0:01:28.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,will temper this young man's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:32.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:43.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.96,0:01:58.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why do you look different from before ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.16,0:02:01.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ma Liang was a possessed body.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.08,0:02:02.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,Of course, I look different.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.29,0:02:04.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,What you see in front of you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.86,0:02:06.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,is my real appearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.72,0:02:09.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.88,0:02:12.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,you said you wanted a pill to breakthrough ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.64,0:02:13.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.88,0:02:16.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have a special cultivation method.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.38,0:02:18.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have to rely on this body to breakthrough.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.08,0:02:23.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Although you will need many pills to reach Core Formation,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.24,0:02:24.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can make them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.44,0:02:27.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,But reaching Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.48,0:02:29.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,requires much more spiritual energy...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.62,0:02:31.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you take so many pills within such a short time,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.88,0:02:33.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior will poison himself !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.50,0:02:36.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't worry,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.76,0:02:38.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,I use an ancient technique
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.92,0:02:41.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,that allows me to take as many pills as needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.88,0:02:45.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then I'll help you breakthrough to Core Formation first.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.56,0:02:47.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,These pills should be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.08,0:02:50.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,Here are items I gathered over the years.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.97,0:02:53.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,See if you can find something valuable here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.60,0:03:06.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.04,0:03:09.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,where did you get this thing ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.28,0:03:10.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,This ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.44,0:03:12.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is it a treasure ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.36,0:03:14.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,If we can open this furnace
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.11,0:03:16.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,you will be able to breakthrough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.64,0:03:18.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Really ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.48,0:03:21.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,This talisman is called a pill seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.67,0:03:23.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,It feeds a pill with spiritual energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.63,0:03:25.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,According to the records,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.08,0:03:26.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,it was used on at least grade 6 pills.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.51,0:03:27.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Grade 6 ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.08,0:03:30.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,No matter what the effect of this pill is,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.40,0:03:33.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,it will have enough energy to form a Nascent Soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.60,0:03:35.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.28,0:03:39.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,the method to open a pill seal has been lost to time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.56,0:03:41.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,If we open it forcefully,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.36,0:03:43.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,the quality of the pill will drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.16,0:03:45.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,It may even
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.68,0:03:47.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,turn the pill to ashes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.32,0:03:54.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,This jade belonged to the person who owned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.61,0:03:56.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,See if you can find a way to break the seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.17,0:04:00.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,In this jade,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.36,0:04:02.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,there are just pill recipes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.20,0:04:03.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,There isn't such a method...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.37,0:04:07.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.36,0:04:09.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior, focus on reaching Core Formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.45,0:04:10.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,As for opening the pill seal,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.88,0:04:12.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,leave it to Wan'er.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.50,0:04:18.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.60,0:04:20.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,this is a grade 2 Yellow Spring Pill,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.80,0:04:22.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,it will expand your meridians
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.44,0:04:23.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,so you should take it first.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.38,0:04:26.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,But it's very toxic
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.28,0:04:27.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,so you have to be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.63,0:04:41.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is a Three Purification Pill,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.52,0:04:45.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,it will cleanse your meridians, easing the flow of spiritual energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.70,0:04:50.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is a Mystic Ice Pill,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.52,0:04:52.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,it will help you with your cold-type cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.24,0:04:55.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the Thousand Chances Pill,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.66,0:04:57.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,it can absorb the essence of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.80,0:04:59.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Barrier Breaking Pill
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.69,0:05:01.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,will dissipate the barriers
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.31,0:05:03.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,formed in your body by pills.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.90,0:05:08.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the Primordial Unity Pill,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.97,0:05:09.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's a tonic.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.76,0:05:14.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,How can you swallow a Primordial Unity Pill like a candy !?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.52,0:05:17.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,I worked hard to get one when I was alive...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.60,0:05:21.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,This one is also a treasure !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.69,0:05:23.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're wasting them...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.28,0:05:24.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're just forming your Core,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.55,0:05:27.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,you should be ashamed !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.80,0:05:30.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,One more step, I will combine the three Cold Cores.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.56,0:05:32.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,and reach Core Formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.72,0:05:38.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,A Heaven Separating Pill ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.36,0:05:40.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.14,0:05:41.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.77,0:05:45.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is a Heaven Separating Pill made from Demon Blood Vine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.12,0:05:47.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Its effect isn't... as good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.52,0:05:48.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,But !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.59,0:06:14.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,It seems
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.92,0:06:17.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,the pill seal needs a lot of energy to be opened.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.90,0:06:32.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mystic Wild Grass,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.08,0:06:33.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,cold type.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.90,0:06:36.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,It has the effect of absorbing spiritual energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.36,0:06:38.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,This may be it !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.88,0:06:40.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,I just need a few excipients
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.08,0:06:43.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,and I can try to break open the pill seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.44,0:07:10.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,What have you two found out in the month of spying on her ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.36,0:07:15.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Elder Li's research was all over the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.12,0:07:19.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,From pill recipes to meditation effects.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.12,0:07:21.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,According to our observations,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.59,0:07:23.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,there wasn't anything that stood out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.58,0:07:27.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Did she record anything ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.84,0:07:29.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.88,0:07:32.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,but it's equally as random.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.32,0:07:34.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's as if she didn't have a goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.16,0:07:37.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Young Master,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.90,0:07:39.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,as a top 3 alchemist of the Cloud Sky Sect,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.68,0:07:41.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Elder Li is very clever and cautious.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.24,0:07:44.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,She hid her search among other things.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.92,0:07:46.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,If that's the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.48,0:07:48.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,then she has succeeded.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.40,0:07:50.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Incompetent fools !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.58,0:08:00.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's the point of being angry at them ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.00,0:08:01.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Look at you,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.12,0:08:04.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,you don't look like an elder.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.08,0:08:06.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, we're leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.60,0:08:09.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.60,0:08:11.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,your son almost died !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.24,0:08:13.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,That ghost
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.00,0:08:15.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,appeared in front of me !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.73,0:08:17.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I didn't have that spirit bell,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.68,0:08:19.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'd be no more than a piece of flesh !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.92,0:08:22.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the past few days,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.24,0:08:24.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,only that bitch's friend entered the Cloud Sky Sect.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.93,0:08:26.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,It must have something to do with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.28,0:08:28.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,I want them dead !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.40,0:08:33.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't worry,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.86,0:08:36.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,if that coward kid dares to show up again,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.56,0:08:38.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will definitely make him pay for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.72,0:08:43.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,You just need to prepare for the wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.20,0:09:03.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't have enough spiritual energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.60,0:09:06.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have to go back to the Library
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.79,0:09:09.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,to find a way to increase it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.00,0:09:23.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.32,0:09:25.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't bother my cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.65,0:09:29.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are about to get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.68,0:09:32.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why are you so cold ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.01,0:09:36.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,I forgot to ask you earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.84,0:09:38.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's your relationship
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.24,0:09:40.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,with that man ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.10,0:09:44.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Does this also need to be reported to Elder Sun ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.96,0:09:52.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wan'er,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.34,0:09:55.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,the sect made a lot of preparations.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.21,0:09:56.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Look,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.04,0:09:57.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,they sent a gift in advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.00,0:09:59.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do you like it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.74,0:10:05.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can think that I don't care
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.60,0:10:07.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,but you are very important to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.76,0:10:10.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,I won't let you run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.11,0:10:12.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,This marriage
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.32,0:10:14.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,will go through
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.16,0:10:17.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,even if you don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.83,0:10:23.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Sect Leader has ordered that
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.64,0:10:25.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Elder Li cannot leave the Southern Courtyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.43,0:10:27.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,She will prepare
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.92,0:10:29.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,for the Dual Cultivation ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.84,0:10:31.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Without a direct order from the Cloud Sky Sect,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.84,0:10:32.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,she cannot leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.32,0:10:34.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Understood !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.86,0:11:34.12,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1621,471)\fad(300,300)}Wang Lin's avatar\NEarly stage Core Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.16,0:11:38.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Oh my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.84,0:11:40.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,In just a month,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.20,0:11:43.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master already reached Core Formation !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.06,0:11:45.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Disc...iple...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.50,0:11:50.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.48,0:11:52.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,really reached Core Formation ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.06,0:11:54.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,As expected
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.36,0:11:56.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,of Teacher's old friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.92,0:11:59.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Should I... call you Uncle ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.26,0:12:02.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,You kindly taught me alchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.39,0:12:03.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,You don't have to be so polite.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.49,0:12:09.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is something going on with Wan'er ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.87,0:12:12.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Teacher was grounded by Sun Zhenwei.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.56,0:12:13.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,She cannot leave
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.80,0:12:15.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Southern Courtyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.92,0:12:17.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid this will go on
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.29,0:12:18.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,until the ceremony is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.96,0:12:23.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,She asked me to give you this jade.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.76,0:12:25.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.93,0:12:27.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wan'er's is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.36,0:12:28.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.28,0:12:32.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,The pill seal needs a lot of spiritual energy
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.20,0:12:34.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,to be opened safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.06,0:12:37.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wan'er is trapped in the Southern Courtyard,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.84,0:12:40.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,unable to find the required herbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.90,0:12:41.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.92,0:12:43.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can only think of only one way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.20,0:12:46.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,There is a talisman at the top floor of the Library.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.70,0:12:48.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you can get it,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.08,0:12:50.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,we will borrow the power
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.12,0:12:52.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,of the Heaven Stealing Furnace
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.04,0:12:53.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,to open the pill seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.84,0:12:57.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,The top floor of the Library is very strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.33,0:12:59.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,I heard that when it was being built,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.26,0:13:01.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,the sect spent a lot of money
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.84,0:13:04.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,to hire a cultivator from a rank 4 country.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.00,0:13:07.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,He came to polish the white jade pillars.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.80,0:13:09.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,It was only completed a few months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.84,0:13:11.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Moreover,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.08,0:13:13.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,a Nascent Soul Elder guards it nonstop.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.60,0:13:15.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you want to take that talisman,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.36,0:13:16.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,it won't be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.91,0:13:50.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,This jade pillar
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.56,0:13:52.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,has defensive restrictions on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.80,0:14:25.42,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1627,526)\fad(300,300)}Lu Fei\NOuter Cloud Sky Sect Elder\NEarly stage Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.68,0:14:24.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,You dare enter the Library of the Cloud Sky Sect ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.28,0:14:26.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,You deserve to be executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.57,0:14:30.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even with restrictions, there is still a guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.56,0:14:31.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,This means that
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.62,0:14:33.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,the restriction only snares
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.17,0:14:34.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,while the cultivator attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.51,0:14:38.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can't beat a Nascent Soul myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.27,0:14:39.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,But with these restrictions in my hands
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.72,0:14:41.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,an Early stage Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.60,0:14:43.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,cannot defeat me either.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.87,0:14:56.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,How can he control the restrictions !?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.19,0:14:58.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,This guy must be caught !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.82,0:15:11.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,You overestimate yourself !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.20,0:15:17.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,No matter how powerful you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.15,0:15:19.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,you're still just a Core Formation brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.52,0:15:31.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,What kind of spell is this ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.06,0:15:32.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,You brat !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.34,0:15:35.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just you wait !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.23,0:15:37.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,With my Core Formation cultivation
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.17,0:15:40.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can only bind him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.32,0:15:42.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,When I use the flag at Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.96,0:15:44.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,I wonder how strong it will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.60,0:16:06.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,Did you hear ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.88,0:16:07.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,That thief
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.76,0:16:09.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,not only stole a talisman
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.36,0:16:11.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,but then he completely vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.68,0:16:13.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Nascent Soul Elders are worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.08,0:16:15.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everyone in the sect is being interrogated.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.24,0:16:17.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Nascent Soul Elders
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.84,0:16:19.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,investigated using their Divine Sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.28,0:16:22.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master is only at Core Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.08,0:16:25.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,but his Divine Sense is stronger than theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.76,0:16:27.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even after probing him
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.92,0:16:30.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,they couldn't find anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.20,0:16:36.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(223,547)}3 days later
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.04,0:16:39.32,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1557,544)\fad(300,300)}Ouyang Zi\NMaster Alchemist of the Cloud Sky Sect\NEarly stage Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.69,0:16:39.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,The hour of Yin has come.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.84,0:16:41.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.44,0:16:43.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,open the furnace.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.16,0:17:22.04,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I've had my share of wounds,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.20,0:17:22.04,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}now I want to fight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.12,0:17:25.60,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Is my destiny a wall of restrictions
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.68,0:17:31.52,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}that's blocking all my hopes
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.56,0:17:31.52,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}for life ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.32,0:17:37.28,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}My flesh and blood witnessed the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.04,0:17:37.28,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}my adversity pushed me to brave the waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.60,0:17:40.68,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}How do you navigate through the years passing by ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.04,0:17:46.68,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Nirvana and rebirth are no longer
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.76,0:17:46.68,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}out of reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.04,0:17:52.16,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.08,0:17:52.16,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}are obsessed with delusions of grandeur.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.44,0:17:56.20,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Renegades
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.20,0:17:56.20,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}seek to crush the impermanence of the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.20,0:18:00.04,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Don't tell me that I overestimate myself
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.15,0:18:00.04,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}and that the path to revenge leads to hell
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.28,0:18:04.16,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}because I don't see the harm in that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.16,0:18:11.96,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}My new body opens its eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.68,0:18:11.96,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}and awakens from its dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.08,0:18:19.52,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}I have overcome many trials
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.20,0:18:19.52,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}to get this body back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.72,0:18:27.16,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}No matter how many endless dark nights go by,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.76,0:18:27.16,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}I can still see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.56,0:18:36.52,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}By sticking to this thought, I will get it done
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.52,0:18:36.52,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}by my own hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.96,0:18:57.92,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}Returning to my body opened my eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.68,0:18:57.92,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}I need to continue my Immortal journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.92,0:19:05.48,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}With a flick of a finger,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.36,0:19:05.48,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}only my indomitable heart remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.52,0:19:14.88,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}Life and death trials temper me, I am not afraid of losing my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.48,0:19:14.88,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}Even if there are countless tribulations and hardships.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.12,0:19:22.72,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}Overcome this fate, smash through the obstacles,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.64,0:19:22.72,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}like the descent of a god.
